Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:44:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 29/48] ntdsapi: Implement DsGetSpnW() and DsFreeSpnArrayW().

SQL Server calls DsGetSpnW() at startup to register its service principal
names and aborts when it is missing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016s12iuoTmYVZJQsft4SbDV
